    <title>Vol 52-如何像谷爱凌一样学习？（成为超级学习者）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c4f5e4852cf1b8bbfcb5d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c4f5e4852cf1b8bbfcb5d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期Highlight：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 谷爱凌是我的偶像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 全情的投入就不是浪费时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 要学什么东西，背后是想清楚你为什么要学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 有自学能力的人，他始终能把自己作为方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 就算不懂，你也可以先做起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 一定要在真实的场景里模拟练习（为什么多邻国式的学习无效）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 学传统学科，教科书是永远的神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a> 真正的学习，是你在清晰和模糊的边缘游走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> 会休息的人才是会工作会学习的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2612">43:32</a> 一个学AI方法：比你收藏一千篇教程都管用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> 好奇心是最好的动力源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2959">49:19</a> 成年人你和我不坐在一个课堂里，同样也不做同一份考卷</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>谷爱凌纪录片：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《谷爱凌：我，18》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《冰雪之巅》第一季第3集；第二季第1集</span></p><span></span><p><span>《谷爱凌再出发》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/691ff4346018cc2c98e3cde5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/691ff4346018cc2c98e3cde5"><span>Vol 45-普通人如何用AI深度学习，10倍提升知识吸收效果？</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于主播，松月：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号，野生运营社区</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书，</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/AA0fLB5logA" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/AA0fLB5logA"><span>是松月呀</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>即刻，</span><a href="https://okjk.co/Z2W5st" data-url="https://okjk.co/Z2W5st"><span>是松月呀</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>听友进群，添加微信号 songyue-growth ，并备注听友进群。</span></p>]]></description>
