    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69aa6587c8cdeb38c21410e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69aa6587c8cdeb38c21410e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Mar 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有能量的人才有能量溢出，真正的活力和生命力，不是咬牙坚持，也不是所谓的自律，而是你内在能量丰沛后的自然流淌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家通过这期节目，能通过一些正向、可增益的生活系统和习惯，去构建一个真正属于你自己的，一个可持续的内部能量系统，笔芯！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期Highlight：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 没想到吧？我居然是低能量人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 一个有意思观察，小孩都是高能量哎！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 没人天生高能量，也没人天生低能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 高能量是一种“全情投入”的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 高能量的人自带节奏感，能快的起来也能慢的下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 能恰如其分享受无聊，是一种能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 一个暴论：社交媒体是人体能量的搅动器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 睡眠＞锻炼＞饮食＞情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 硬要求 VS 软要求，让我自律且快乐的活着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> Gemini给的“松月的不做清单”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 要像热刀切黄油一样，切割你的注意力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> 人是导管，快乐流过，悲哀流过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a> 真正的生命力，是内在能量丰沛后的自然流淌</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/692eefc14ef12f9fe98ab699" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/692eefc14ef12f9fe98ab699"><span>Vol 46-每天执行力拉满的人，支撑他们的到底是什么东西啊！</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于主播，松月：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号，野生运营社区</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书，</span><a href="https:/