    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期Highlight：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 建议：每半年进行一次个人财务体检</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 有了财富框架，才有财富增长的正循环系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 认知模块、产品模块、杠杆模块和资产模块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 普通人的财富的升级打怪地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 如何优化“出售时间”的效率（提高时薪 VS 时间上一鱼多吃）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 要带着清醒的思路去打工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 朋友圈摆个摊，快速验证商业假设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a>“差不多得了”原则，释放你的宝贵精力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 你要给你投资的这笔钱，判一个“无期徒刑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a> 普通人可以运用的3类资产（钱生钱）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2559">42:39</a> 我的资产配置方案（2026年版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">44:56</a> 金钱永远是手段，人才是目的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2963">49:23</a> 每个人都要玩自己的游戏，财富这一局也是如此</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/665aec7263c334a2fb9bac69" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/665aec7263c334a2fb9bac69"><span>Vol 17-职场通关宝典 | 找工作、会跳槽、找到终身职业……一路打怪升级，So easy!</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66eea35a87a9242776d58f69" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66eea35a87a9242776d58f69"><span>Vol-25-聊聊消费观｜如何花钱才能实现人生幸福最大化，且遗憾最小化？</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于主播，松月：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公