    <guid isPermaLink="false">696b2577109824f9e1f5674d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期Highligt：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 三大生产力原则</span></p><span></span><p><span>1）不是越多越好</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）注意力才是最强生产力</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）不存在"学工具"这个问题（应该是干中学）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> AI时代，你的输出就是“数字化留痕”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> 我坚持了很多年的「瀑布流日记」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> Get笔记3个小众用法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 写日记最大的意义，是对抗遗忘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 我是如何榨干一期播客的全部价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> 豆包的7个小众用法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 我的内容智能体工作流：结构大师→风格大师→配图助手→SEO优化助手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3163">52:43</a> 三个摆脱信息焦虑的小习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span>1）脑子的16+8轻断食</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）每周固定时间整理备忘录和知识库</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）消灭碎片化时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 2026年我对自己的期待：保持好奇、长期主义、多睡点觉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提到的生产力工具：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Get笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>趁早效率手册</span></p><span></span><p><span>得到电子书</span></p><span></span><p><span>海信A9墨水屏手机</span></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube（推荐Andrej Karpathy、Jeff Su、YC/OpenAI官方等AI学习频道）、即刻（AI探索站圈）、Reddit</span></p><span></span><p><span>付费订阅内容源：财新、国家地理、看理想</span></p><span></span><p><span>沉浸式翻译（电脑插件&amp;手机App）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gemini（工作助手）、豆包（生活搭子）、Claude（文字处理最佳）、NotebookLM和Nano Banana（掌管作图的神）</span></p><span></span><p><span>智能体创建：Poe、Gemini、智谱和腾讯元器</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我做的毛选日历（通过Gemini